{"3630810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shelf Life 2", "steam_appid": 3630810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rift is growing between Ron Edison and the President of the United States. The suspicious death of a disgraced financier and the scramble to expose his secret files threaten to shake the foundation of global order. The player dons the Target Suit, kitted out with a new and enhanced suite of abilities, and sets out on a globetrotting adventure to protect Ron's interest and ensure neither of them end up in a government detention facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Life 2 builds on the Shelf Life 1's setting and gameplay. Levels are larger and more varied, taking you from abandoned casino hotels to distant space colonies. Your weapons suite expands to include modernizations of forgotten technical marvels and patented tech so cutting edge it literally explodes to keep competitors away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rift is growing between Ron Edison and the President of the United States. The suspicious death of a disgraced financier and the scramble to expose his secret files threaten to shake the foundation of global order. The player dons the Target Suit, kitted out with a new and enhanced suite of abilities, and sets out on a globetrotting adventure to protect Ron's interest and ensure neither of them end up in a government detention facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Life 2 builds on the Shelf Life 1's setting and gameplay. Levels are larger and more varied, taking you from abandoned casino hotels to distant space colonies. Your weapons suite expands to include modernizations of forgotten technical marvels and patented tech so cutting edge it literally explodes to keep competitors away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_descripti